        {
          "es": "Una noche despejada, mirá hacia el norte.",
          "en": "On a clear night, look north."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los mexicas veían un jaguar en las estrellas de la Osa Mayor.",
          "en": "The Mexica saw a jaguar in the stars of the Great Bear."
        },
        {
          "es": "Decían que era Tezcatlipoca, el dios que cayó del cielo.",
          "en": "They said it was Tezcatlipoca, the god who fell from the sky."
        },
        {
          "es": "A veces esas estrellas bajan hasta el agua.",
          "en": "At times, those stars sink down toward the water."
        }
